      "lines": [
        "29．变形成一个分式：",
        "а）$\\frac b{a^2}-\\frac1a$；　　б）$\\frac{1-x}{x^3}+\\frac1{x^2}$；",
        "в）$\\frac{a+b}{a^2}+\\frac{a-b}{ab}$；　　г）$\\frac{x-y}{xy}-\\frac{x-z}{xz}$；",
        "д）$\\frac{2a-3b}{a^2b}+\\frac{4a-5b}{ab^2}$；　　е）$\\frac{x-2y}{xy^2}-\\frac{2x-y}{x^2y}$；",
        "ж）$\\frac{2-a^3}{a^{10}}+\\frac1{a^7}$；　　з）$\\frac{1+x^4}{x^{12}}-\\frac1{x^8}$．"
